 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "LazyArray(arr) stores an integer array. map(operation, operand) appends a deferred transformation applied to every element: operation is \"add\" (x becomes x + operand) or \"multiply\" (x becomes x * operand). indexOf(target) returns the smallest index i such that arr[i], after all transformations recorded so far applied in order, equals target, or -1 when none does. map changes this instance (it does not return a new array); the stored input array is never modified. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk15-b-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
